<view class="container">
  <view class="header">
    <text class="title">绑定 Obsidian</text>
    <text class="desc">在 Obsidian 插件中生成绑定码后，在此确认绑定</text>
  </view>

  <view class="bind-form">
    <input 
      class="input" 
      type="text" 
      placeholder="请输入绑定码" 
      value="{{bindCode}}"
      bindinput="onCodeInput"
      maxlength="20"
    />
    <button class="btn btn-primary" bindtap="confirmBind" loading="{{loading}}">
      确认绑定
    </button>
  </view>

  <view class="tips">
    <text class="tips-title">如何获取绑定码？</text>
    <text class="tips-item">1. 打开 Obsidian</text>
    <text class="tips-item">2. 进入 设置 → Obsync 插件</text>
    <text class="tips-item">3. 点击「生成绑定码」</text>
    <text class="tips-item">4. 将显示的绑定码填入上方输入框</text>
  </view>
</view>
